      "x": 1150,
      "y": 3480
    },
    {
      "height": 60,
      "id": "cdf28644e7f266ba",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "Swerve Concepts",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 260,
      "x": 1490,
      "y": 3480
    },
    {
      "height": 281,
      "id": "6a7c12b5c0e475ee",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "Advanced Control\n\nDetermine control options\n- Model/Feedforwards?\n- Feedback\n\t- PID\n\t- Bang-Bang\n\t- State-oriented\n- Motion Profiles?",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 260,
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 4386
    },
    {
      "height": 325,
      "id": "8e8d2bbfd0c0d5e1",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "Managing System State\n- State = robot/mechanism configuration\n- Multi-system interactions\n- Subsystem initialization\n- Command Groups\n- State Machines? \n- Sequencing?",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 260,
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 4715
    },
    {
      "color": "1",
      "height": 200,
      "id": "e562c9199e4b4dfe",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "# Advanced Control Goals\n- Sensor integration\n-  Simple feed-forward modelling\n-   Basic PID feedback controls\n- Basic motion profile\n- Simple  State-oriented actions",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 420,
      "x": 780,
      "y": 4840
    },
